                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip2:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 烟花火箭" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="一共有约2&amp;times;10136种不同的烟花火箭，这个数字远比Java版和基岩版的世界种子数加起来还要多。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 光线追踪（生物）" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="french_mode规则下光线追踪重复的“Omelette du fromage”引用了Cartoon Network的动画系列Dexter&apos;s Laboratory。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 潜影盒" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="潜影盒为俯视顺时针旋转打开、逆时针旋转关闭；基岩版为俯视逆时针旋转打开、顺时针旋转关闭，且旋转速度在接近打开时变慢，接近关闭时变快。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                            <TextBlock Text="来源：" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       Foreground="#4A8CF7" />
